    "Action Keys" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Teclas de acción"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Action kinds Docky will execute: built-in commands, AppleScript, and macOS menu-bar clicks. The first time an app-targeted AppleScript or menu-click action runs, macOS may prompt for Automation permission." : {

    },
    "Actions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Acciones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Actions are menu items Docky adds to each tile's right-click menu. Every action a loaded package defines is available on the matching tiles." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las acciones son elementos que Docky añade al menú contextual de cada ícono. Todas las acciones que define un paquete cargado están disponibles en los íconos correspondientes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Actions are menu items Docky injects into each tile's right-click menu. A catalog package ships a curated bundle of them; once it's loaded, every action it defines is automatically available on the matching tile type. Apps, folders, the Trash, the Launchpad, and the divider all get their own set, with no per-tile setup needed." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how actions are integrated into Docky.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Active" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Active Space" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Space activo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Active Space lists only windows on a Space you're viewing. Hover previews follow Show Apps From in Taskbar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Space activo muestra solo las ventanas en un Space que estás viendo. Las vistas previas al pasar el cursor siguen Mostrar apps de en Barra de tareas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Active Space shows only apps with a window on a Space you're viewing, and lists only those Spaces' windows in previews and the overflow menu. Pinned apps always show. Needs Accessibility access." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Space activo muestra solo las apps con una ventana en un Space que estás viendo, y en las vistas previas y el menú adicional solo muestra las ventanas de esos Spaces. Las apps fijadas siempre se muestran. Requiere acceso de Accesibilidad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
